      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0021,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 8,
      "start_time": 37.0,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "when I saw that first one? Or that I very nearly switched over to it",
      "duration": 3.0,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0021,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "start_time": 40.0,
      "end_time": 43.48,
      "text": "when I tested the Z Flip 4 last year? And that now we have the five,",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0021,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 10,
      "start_time": 43.48,
      "end_time": 47.480000000000004,
      "text": "I've decided that I'm actually going to try and use this thing on a day-to-day basis.",
      "duration": 4.0,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0021,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 11,
      "start_time": 47.480000000000004,
      "end_time": 52.64,
      "text": "Well, let's start with what's new. The storage has doubled from 128GB to 256,",
      "duration": 5.16,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0021,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 12,
      "start_time": 52.64,
      "end_time": 56.08,
      "text": "although the price has also gone up too, so that's not really a perk.",
